20:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-International admission qualifications and 2026 timing",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"International admission qualifications and 2026 timing"}],[["$","p","The official indexed 2026 record lists TR-YÖS sessions 2024/2, 2025/1, 2025/2 and 2026/1, alongside GCE A-levels, SAT, ACT, IB, French Baccalaureate, Abitur and Austrian Matura. A listed qualification must still satisfy the programme’s conditions.",{"children":"The official indexed 2026 record lists TR-YÖS sessions 2024/2, 2025/1, 2025/2 and 2026/1, alongside GCE A-levels, SAT, ACT, IB, French Baccalaureate, Abitur and Austrian Matura. A listed qualification must still satisfy the programme’s conditions."}],["$","p","The 2026 preference window shown in that record was 13–20 July 2026 and has passed. Do not extend the deadline into the next year. Check the next named call for its qualification versions, quotas and sequence.",{"children":"The 2026 preference window shown in that record was 13–20 July 2026 and has passed. Do not extend the deadline into the next year. Check the next named call for its qualification versions, quotas and sequence."}],["$","p","Keep a copy of the accepted-result rule with your score report. If a more recent exam session is not in the old list, that does not establish the rule for a future call; the new admissions announcement decides.",{"children":"Keep a copy of the accepted-result rule with your score report. If a more recent exam session is not in the old list, that does not establish the rule for a future call; the new admissions announcement decides."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://isad.istanbul.edu.tr/en/content/application/application-requirements",{"children":["",["$","a"